tag=$OKTA_USERS json id created activated
| last id
| time created aTS
| time activated bTS
| eval
    n = 0; days = 0.0;
    if (has(aTS) && has(bTS)) { n = 1; days = float(unix(bTS) - unix(aTS)) / 86400.0; }
| stats sum(days) as total sum(n) as users
| eval count = 0; if (users > 0) { count = math_floor(total / float(users)); }
| alias count " "
| numbercard " "
